  "creatureType": "Humanoid",
  "size": "Medium (about 6–7 feet tall)",
  "speed": "30 feet",
  "traits": [
    {
      "name": "Adrenaline Rush",
      "rulesText": "You can take the Dash action as a Bonus Action. When you do so, you gain a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to your Proficiency Bonus.\n\nYou can use this trait a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or Long Rest."
    },
    {
      "name": "Darkvision",
      "rulesText": "You have Darkvision with a range of 120 feet."
    },
    {
      "name": "Relentless Endurance",
      "rulesText": "When you are reduced to 0 Hit Points but not killed outright, you can drop to 1 Hit Point instead. Once you use this trait, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest."
    }
  ],
  "rulesText": "Creature Type: Humanoid\n\nSize: Medium (about 6–7 feet tall)\n\nSpeed: 30 feet\n\nAs an Orc, you have these special traits.\n\nAdrenaline Rush. You can take the Dash action as a Bonus Action. When you do so, you gain a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to your Proficiency Bonus.\n\nYou can use this trait a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or Long Rest.\n\nDarkvision. You have Darkvision with a range of 120 feet.\n\nRelentless Endurance. When you are reduced to 0 Hit Points but not killed outright, you can drop to 1 Hit Point instead. Once you use this trait, you can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest."
}
